<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>G - O - D spells God,</l><l>Then add one O, and it spells good!</l><l>G - O - D spells God;</l><l>G - O - O - D, good!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Give thanks to Jehovah</l><l>For He’s good; for He is good.</l><l>Only God is good! Only God is good!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
